rem First Sort I
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=523

use numbers
use sequences
use io
use cli

option N integer = 30

rem With prefix sums P, n E(n) = P(n -
rem 1) + 2^n - n - 1. Differencing two
rem steps leaves n (E(n) - E(n - 1)) =
rem 2^(n - 1) - 1, so E(n) is the sum
rem of (2^(j - 1) - 1) / j for j <= n.
J = (1 to N) copy
E = ((2.0 ** (J - 1) - 1) / J) sum
Answer = E 2 round
Answer print
